<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to buy diesel for July delivery.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy diesel for July delivery.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued a tender to buy high speed diesel or 1.0-percent sulphur gas oil for July delivery, an industry source said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The tender seeks 40,000-to-45,000-tonne cargoes for delivery to Madras or Haldia on the Indian east coast and the same volume to Kandla on the west coast.</p>
<p>The tender closes on May 27 and offers will be valid until May 29.</p>
<p>IOC bought 270,000 tonnes of 1.0-percent sulphur gas oil in its last tender for June deliveries.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870 3084)</p>
